WEBVTT

00:13.221 --> 00:15.432
Hey, Roman! Hey!

00:15.515 --> 00:18.935
Huh? He's gone. Guess he couldn't hear me.

00:19.019 --> 00:21.229
No use calling him
when he's got his camera out.

00:21.312 --> 00:22.313
No use?

00:22.397 --> 00:24.190
He can’t hear you.
Gets all wrapped up.

00:24.274 --> 00:25.567
In what?

00:25.650 --> 00:26.651
His camera.

00:26.735 --> 00:27.944
Why would he care about that?

00:28.528 --> 00:29.696
Says he likes it.

00:30.196 --> 00:31.948
Does he use it for BD and stuff?

00:32.532 --> 00:34.451
No, he likes cinema.

00:35.035 --> 00:37.704
"Cinema"? What's a "cinema"?

00:39.205 --> 00:40.957
Such a gonkbrain...

00:41.708 --> 00:44.461
You watch 'em on a screen in a dark room.

00:44.544 --> 00:48.214
Know-it-all! You even been to one?

00:48.298 --> 00:50.091
I mean... No...

02:49.210 --> 02:52.046
You... don't work here, do you?

03:04.309 --> 03:06.895
That's 30 seconds
we don't get back, Miguel.

03:06.978 --> 03:08.396
Get it together.

03:09.272 --> 03:10.648
S-sorry 'bout that, King.

03:11.691 --> 03:13.484
Just leave the body!

03:14.235 --> 03:16.779
Miguel. You're too sloppy.

03:17.864 --> 03:20.491
Hey, can we not tell Emily about this?

03:24.078 --> 03:26.873
Fuck! These boxes all look the same!

03:26.956 --> 03:29.125
Chill, Miguel. Knew this might happen.

03:29.208 --> 03:30.335
So which is ours?

03:30.418 --> 03:34.339
Left side... that row.
Hop two to the right... Bingo.

03:38.968 --> 03:40.094
Find it?

03:40.178 --> 03:41.554
Are we sure?

03:41.638 --> 03:42.889
Hold it up for me?

03:42.972 --> 03:45.850
AR-CPRN-XR-05.

03:46.392 --> 03:47.852
Yep, that's our mark.

03:47.936 --> 03:49.229
Got it!

03:49.312 --> 03:50.980
What the hell are you doing?

03:51.064 --> 03:54.817
Hey! Careful with it.
Case has a biochip inside!

03:54.901 --> 03:55.902
Avida?

03:55.985 --> 03:58.112
Yeah, yeah. I know!

03:58.196 --> 03:59.906
Phew, it's cold!

04:00.823 --> 04:01.824
Target secured.

04:02.492 --> 04:04.369
...Hey! Said we got the case!

04:05.745 --> 04:07.789
King! You hear me?

04:13.169 --> 04:15.255
What, Miguel? You got the case?

04:15.338 --> 04:17.090
Hey... C'mon, man...

04:17.173 --> 04:19.092
We have it! Let's delta!

04:19.175 --> 04:21.552
Seriously, guys...

04:22.303 --> 04:23.346
Our ride?

04:23.429 --> 04:25.223
Hacked the one sitting out front.

04:25.306 --> 04:26.557
And our wheelman?

04:26.641 --> 04:29.602
Not included! Better figure it out...

04:30.436 --> 04:31.479
...Hold on.

04:32.981 --> 04:33.982
Somethin' wrong?

04:34.857 --> 04:36.985
- Hey, Meshuga?
- Shit! Fall ba--

04:38.528 --> 04:39.612
The door!

04:41.864 --> 04:43.825
King! Run a scan!

05:05.888 --> 05:06.889
Miguel!

05:25.575 --> 05:26.659
Hey! Hold it right--

05:30.830 --> 05:31.956
Miguel, the car!

05:32.040 --> 05:33.624
I know!

05:35.001 --> 05:37.086
Yo, that a fire?

05:37.170 --> 05:39.130
Ain't that Arasaka turf?

05:39.922 --> 05:43.176
What's this? Could it
be major breaking news?

05:43.968 --> 05:45.470
Eh, I wish...

05:50.558 --> 05:51.601
Not takin' my eyes off--

05:52.769 --> 05:54.228
Hey! Watch where you're... walking...

05:54.312 --> 05:56.606
- Freeze! Stop right there, or--
- The fuck did you say, kid?

05:56.689 --> 05:58.858
Whoa! S-s-s-sorry!

06:10.328 --> 06:12.705
Shit! What is it with today?

06:13.956 --> 06:16.459
Emily, are you okay? Hey!

06:16.542 --> 06:18.044
More or less...

06:18.127 --> 06:20.755
King! The fuck is your problem, old man?

06:20.838 --> 06:23.007
Miguel, the case...

06:23.091 --> 06:25.343
Just leave it! The gig's a bust.

06:26.135 --> 06:27.470
Hey! Stop where you are!

06:34.977 --> 06:36.104
Avida...

06:41.317 --> 06:47.406
Avida!

06:57.083 --> 06:58.835
Avida!

07:18.438 --> 07:21.149
C'mon, Emily. Hang in there.

07:21.732 --> 07:24.652
We... we gotta get you to a clinic...

07:26.863 --> 07:30.116
Forget it... Save yourself and run, Miguel.

07:30.199 --> 07:34.495
Don't say shit like that!
Fuck... What's wrong with King?

07:34.579 --> 07:36.414
Cyberpsychosis.

07:36.998 --> 07:38.916
I saw it when our eyes met.

07:39.834 --> 07:42.712
That look in his eyes... He's gone psycho.

07:49.927 --> 07:56.934
———... ——— at ——— Cyberpsycho...

08:07.612 --> 08:08.988
What a mess.

08:09.572 --> 08:12.658
Hey. Clockin' in.

08:12.742 --> 08:14.952
Uh, whatcha watchin'?

08:15.036 --> 08:16.412
A freelance video.

08:16.496 --> 08:19.790
Video? But we're a BD shop.

08:19.874 --> 08:22.960
There's still a market
for vids like these too.

08:23.044 --> 08:26.088
Oh! This that Arasaka thing
from yesterday's newsfeed?

08:26.172 --> 08:29.008
Yup. MaxTac tried to bag a 'psycho...

08:29.091 --> 08:33.513
Only the bastard
had VIP platinum coverage.

08:33.596 --> 08:36.224
Trauma Team came rushing in to save him.

08:36.307 --> 08:39.310
Arasaka was the only one left eatin' shit.

08:39.393 --> 08:43.648
Is Arasaka slippin' or what? Feels like
they're takin' big hits more than ever.

08:44.190 --> 08:47.235
- Hey, did you film this?
- Yeah.

08:47.318 --> 08:48.945
Huh. Not bad.

08:53.074 --> 08:54.242
Oh, and there's Trauma Team.

08:55.326 --> 08:59.163
Old man was doin' good for his age,
but he's finally down for the count.

08:59.247 --> 09:00.456
He famous?

09:00.540 --> 09:01.749
Goes by "King."

09:01.832 --> 09:04.669
"King"? So lame!

09:04.752 --> 09:07.296
Right? Think that's bad,
wait'll I tell ya his real name--

09:07.380 --> 09:08.506
So, what's it worth?

09:11.551 --> 09:14.679
- Two hundo.
- That's cheap. Stupidly cheap.

09:14.762 --> 09:17.014
Forget it! The news would pay way more!

09:17.098 --> 09:21.018
N54 might cough up a hundred, tops.

09:22.395 --> 09:24.522
Fine... 200.

09:26.315 --> 09:28.067
Kinda childish of you.

09:29.485 --> 09:33.364
Quit yappin' and get back to work!
Those raw BDs won't tune themselves!

09:33.447 --> 09:35.533
Yeah, yeah...

09:36.617 --> 09:38.661
Bye-bye, then.

09:39.287 --> 09:40.871
Ugh, back to the grind...

09:48.713 --> 09:53.718
Look, Roman. You wanna make money,
it's all BDs now. Braindance.

09:54.260 --> 09:58.139
Got any idea the kind of eddies
Jessie rakes in with tunejobs these days?

09:58.222 --> 10:01.601
Calling BD tuning "editing" is a stretch.

10:01.684 --> 10:05.187
It's not the same as cutting video.
BDs are just relived memories.

10:05.271 --> 10:06.647
Where's the fun in that?

10:06.731 --> 10:09.317
Man oh man, were you
born in the wrong century.

10:09.400 --> 10:13.571
The people want BDs.
Not the videos you like.

10:14.363 --> 10:16.657
Film's dead.

10:18.200 --> 10:20.494
You can't tell stories with BDs.

10:20.578 --> 10:23.331
Stories? Who needs 'em?

10:23.914 --> 10:28.336
BDs have no boundaries. Nothing
separates the audience from the action.

10:28.419 --> 10:33.341
Films have screens. But great films
pull you right through that boundary.

10:33.424 --> 10:35.176
You forget the screen's there.

10:35.259 --> 10:37.219
That's why they matter.

10:37.303 --> 10:40.222
That's why stories matter.

10:40.306 --> 10:43.225
Little fuckin' philosophizer...

10:44.477 --> 10:47.563
If you don't wanna scroll BDs,
then try scrollin' Maelstrom.

10:47.647 --> 10:50.858
Maelstrom? Those guys're dangerous.

10:50.941 --> 10:52.860
Thought you needed the money.

10:52.943 --> 10:57.657
Footage of them chippin' chrome ain't easy
to come by, but that shit's a hot seller.

10:57.740 --> 11:02.119
That's practically snuff! There's no art
in that! Plus, where would I even start?

11:02.203 --> 11:04.163
Figure it out!

11:04.246 --> 11:06.666
If it was easy, it wouldn't
be worth a damn!

11:06.749 --> 11:10.211
Land me a reel, and I'll pay ya enough
to get a top-shelf camera.

11:10.294 --> 11:13.464
But good cams aren't even
on the market in the first place.

11:15.591 --> 11:19.220
35mm. I've got a 35mm.

11:21.097 --> 11:25.351
Got film, too. Not sure
the fossil still works though...

11:26.018 --> 11:30.606
Get that footage, she's yours.
Or else, there's always BDs.

11:31.273 --> 11:33.234
Maelstrom, huh?

11:34.068 --> 11:38.030
Talia, stop! You're not
getting away this time!

11:38.114 --> 11:40.241
Hey... Talia! I said stop! Tali--

11:40.825 --> 11:43.160
- Talia!
- Miss Yang again?

11:43.244 --> 11:44.620
How many times is that?

11:45.121 --> 11:47.248
The patient is awake.

11:48.124 --> 11:51.502
Fifty days? I was asleep for that long?

11:51.585 --> 11:53.504
Pretty wild, right?

11:53.587 --> 11:55.464
But at least you're alive.

11:55.548 --> 11:58.968
If you didn't have platinum coverage,
you'd be in a MaxTac body bag right now.

11:59.051 --> 12:00.761
Sure is worth the fat price tag.

12:00.845 --> 12:02.054
In a body bag?

12:02.138 --> 12:03.347
MaxTac?

12:03.431 --> 12:07.476
That's right. You nearly had
a full cyberpsychotic break.

12:07.560 --> 12:10.229
Cyberpsychosis? Me?

12:10.312 --> 12:12.648
Hate to say it,
but you overdid the chrome.

12:12.731 --> 12:15.526
There's a limit to how much
the human body can handle.

12:15.609 --> 12:18.779
Add stress and whatever
else on top of that, and well...

12:18.863 --> 12:21.782
No, I was at my peak.

12:21.866 --> 12:23.951
Never felt any stress...

12:24.034 --> 12:27.163
It's fairly common
to show no signs or symptoms.

12:27.246 --> 12:31.250
Truth is, there's still a lot we don't
understand about what triggers it.

12:31.333 --> 12:33.711
But your case was darn near textbook.

12:33.794 --> 12:36.338
You pushed past your limit.
That's just the fact of it.

12:37.006 --> 12:41.469
We've cut the nonessential hardware
and swapped in low-draw alternatives.

12:41.552 --> 12:46.307
Don't worry about your brain goin'
boom for now. Give ya my word.

12:47.349 --> 12:48.434
So how long?

12:49.268 --> 12:51.145
How long before I can use them--

12:51.228 --> 12:53.689
Don't be stupid, choom. You tryna die?

12:53.772 --> 12:56.317
Absolutely no chrome, ever.

12:56.400 --> 12:57.610
You're kidding?

12:57.693 --> 12:59.820
The moment you plug back in...

12:59.904 --> 13:00.946
Kaboom!

13:01.030 --> 13:03.699
And you don't have insurance
to protect you anymore.

13:03.782 --> 13:06.577
There's no stoppin' MaxTac
next time they come for you.

13:07.703 --> 13:09.330
Well, that's that.

13:09.413 --> 13:12.500
Now, let's talk about your bill.

13:12.583 --> 13:16.587
Good thing you saved up!
Care like this would bankrupt most people!

13:16.670 --> 13:20.341
We had to repo a few things to
cover the shortfall, but you're all set!

13:20.674 --> 13:21.592
God bless you!

13:33.312 --> 13:36.482
- King! You're alive?
- Apparently.

13:36.565 --> 13:38.901
I mean... that's great.

13:38.984 --> 13:41.153
Hey, did you say "King"?

13:41.237 --> 13:43.989
That Miguel? You boys at the Afterlife?

13:44.073 --> 13:45.616
Is that him?

13:45.699 --> 13:47.451
Sorry, I'll have to ring ya back.

13:51.330 --> 13:53.332
Miguel, knock it off!

13:54.124 --> 13:56.710
Stop! I said enough, Miguel!

14:01.465 --> 14:04.051
Sorry, folks... Don't mind us.

14:05.344 --> 14:06.971
King, you all right?

14:08.222 --> 14:09.473
Yeah...

14:12.393 --> 14:16.438
Gone soft, have ya?
Lettin' Miguel wallop ya like that...

14:17.314 --> 14:19.483
Guess I need rehab.

14:22.069 --> 14:23.779
You stable now?

14:24.864 --> 14:25.990
I hate to say this, but...

14:26.073 --> 14:28.075
Cyberpsychosis?

14:28.158 --> 14:29.994
- Yeah.
- I'm fine.

14:30.828 --> 14:32.955
But they shut down all my chrome.

14:33.038 --> 14:34.748
Any reactivation's a death sentence.

14:35.332 --> 14:36.584
No shit?

14:36.667 --> 14:38.252
Tell me, Meshuga.

14:38.335 --> 14:40.921
- What happened then--
- You should've died.

14:41.505 --> 14:42.506
Hey...

14:42.590 --> 14:45.384
You fuckin' snapped is what happened.

14:45.467 --> 14:48.387
If you hadn't lost your shit,
Emily would still be...

14:49.471 --> 14:51.140
- Miguel, listen--
- Don't touch me.

14:52.808 --> 14:54.476
Miguel, I...

14:55.102 --> 14:57.146
Don't fuckin' touch me, I said.

14:59.648 --> 15:01.901
Hey, wait, Miguel! It ain't King's fault...

15:01.984 --> 15:03.360
- Lemme go!
- Miguel!

15:03.444 --> 15:04.528
Tell me!

15:04.612 --> 15:10.117
I can't remember.
What did I do? Did Emily--

15:10.200 --> 15:11.952
You fuckin' killed her!

15:12.745 --> 15:13.913
I did?

15:13.996 --> 15:19.335
Why... Why's Emily dead,
but your gonk ass gets to live?

15:19.418 --> 15:21.128
Should've died there with her!

15:21.211 --> 15:23.631
What kinda edgerunner are you?

15:27.593 --> 15:28.928
Meshuga...

15:29.011 --> 15:30.888
You should go.

15:30.971 --> 15:32.765
Talk soon, ay?

15:38.812 --> 15:40.397
Yooo!

15:41.023 --> 15:42.608
Mr. King!

15:47.571 --> 15:51.158
Hey, remember us?

15:52.368 --> 15:55.412
'Course ya don't, do ya?

15:55.496 --> 15:57.247
The "King's" a big deal!

15:58.123 --> 16:00.000
What's with that look?

16:01.919 --> 16:05.005
You chooms ever hear his real name?

16:05.089 --> 16:09.385
Weak Kingsley. "Weak" suits him better.

16:09.927 --> 16:11.261
Crew-killin' piece of shit!

16:11.345 --> 16:14.014
Don't ever show
your face 'round here again!

16:27.319 --> 16:30.447
I'm at the building you told me about.
It's sealed up tight.

16:30.531 --> 16:32.658
Really sure it's here?

16:32.741 --> 16:35.369
'Course. Thereabouts.

16:35.452 --> 16:36.662
"Thereabouts"?

16:36.745 --> 16:38.622
Just poke around.

16:39.540 --> 16:42.960
Old fart's no use at all...

17:42.352 --> 17:44.188
And who are you?

17:49.443 --> 17:50.444
A kid?

17:51.070 --> 17:54.114
Uh, I'm sorry. I filmed without asking...

17:55.032 --> 17:56.867
Ow...

17:57.493 --> 18:00.662
Sorry, but I thought
it wouldn't be safe to call out.

18:01.330 --> 18:04.374
Actually... I'm lookin' for...

18:04.458 --> 18:06.960
Maelstrom...

18:10.172 --> 18:13.050
You're still mostly 'ganic?

18:13.133 --> 18:14.426
Why?

18:14.510 --> 18:19.014
"Why?" I dunno... Not really interested--

18:19.098 --> 18:20.099
Ouch!

18:20.682 --> 18:24.103
How can you be in a body like that?

18:25.062 --> 18:26.605
Whoa! What?

18:26.688 --> 18:27.981
Cross it.

18:32.194 --> 18:35.614
Shouldn'ta filmed without askin'.
I'm really sorry...

18:35.697 --> 18:37.866
Not what we're talking about right now.

18:37.950 --> 18:42.037
You saw me do it.
Now it's my turn to watch you.

18:42.121 --> 18:43.914
No way, I can't!

18:43.997 --> 18:44.998
How come?

18:45.082 --> 18:47.251
'Cause it's impossible without implants!

18:47.334 --> 18:50.712
Yet you think you can
just live without 'em.

18:51.338 --> 18:52.589
So, prove to me you don't.

19:00.264 --> 19:01.682
There she is.

19:01.765 --> 19:04.685
Talia! How's the stabilizer runnin'?

19:04.768 --> 19:06.270
Preem. No issues.

19:06.353 --> 19:08.272
Maelstrom...

19:08.355 --> 19:09.523
Who's the runt?

19:10.274 --> 19:12.401
Yo, he's full 'ganic.

19:12.484 --> 19:14.194
You're right. He's not modded at all.

19:14.278 --> 19:16.905
Says he's interested in you guys.

19:18.574 --> 19:20.784
That's not... exactly what I meant...

19:20.868 --> 19:23.412
Say no more.

19:23.495 --> 19:24.955
Welcome to the club.

19:25.455 --> 19:26.748
The club...

19:27.708 --> 19:29.418
Stop strugglin'.

19:29.501 --> 19:32.254
Relax, you're gonna look sick.

19:37.801 --> 19:39.303
Later, Talia!

19:41.680 --> 19:44.016
Quit your squealin'.

20:01.575 --> 20:03.911
Made a wise choice with us, kid.

20:03.994 --> 20:06.413
No one wants to be all meat.

20:07.414 --> 20:10.125
Been wantin' to give this baby a whirl.

20:10.209 --> 20:11.835
Ooh, you got a new toy?

20:12.920 --> 20:14.588
We said no squealin'.

20:16.465 --> 20:19.593
Now then...
Want anesthesia or nah?

20:20.719 --> 20:22.804
- That a "no"?
- He's so brave!

20:23.513 --> 20:25.474
- A kid?
- Whatever you say.

20:26.016 --> 20:27.351
Showtime.

20:35.943 --> 20:37.819
Rats... Plan's up in dust.

20:39.196 --> 20:40.447
Aaand he's not here.

20:41.323 --> 20:42.574
Hey, you all right?

20:51.124 --> 20:52.417
Another runner!

20:57.047 --> 21:00.509
Can you get out of here on your own?
Not savin' you twice!

21:07.766 --> 21:08.767
Hey.

21:09.768 --> 21:14.564
You know him, right? Fella's name
is Helio. Mind tellin' me where he is?

21:15.565 --> 21:17.150
You understand the position you're in?

21:17.234 --> 21:19.611
Helio ain't in the gang no more!

21:20.862 --> 21:23.115
I'm asking where the hell he is.

21:25.325 --> 21:27.786
Okay, okay, this is where he's holed up!

21:29.955 --> 21:31.290
Cool.

21:41.425 --> 21:42.592
Ah, my camera!

21:45.262 --> 21:46.930
Least I have a backup...

21:49.224 --> 21:50.392
Oh, hey, choom!

21:52.311 --> 21:54.730
Phew, I was worried
you might leave through the front--

21:54.813 --> 22:00.610
You brain-dead? Do you realize you coulda
been killed, chopped up, or worse?

22:01.111 --> 22:03.488
I appreciate you savin' me.

22:04.114 --> 22:06.616
And I wanna show you my thanks.

22:07.326 --> 22:08.660
Your thanks?

22:08.744 --> 22:10.620
Well, I happen to live near by.

22:12.998 --> 22:14.082
Another round.

22:14.875 --> 22:16.543
There is no more.

22:17.544 --> 22:20.422
That's the last of it.
Everything we had in the house.

22:22.049 --> 22:23.300
No more thanks?

22:23.383 --> 22:26.720
I'll... go buy more.

22:44.488 --> 22:46.907
What'm I gonna tell Dad?

22:49.159 --> 22:51.661
No point filmin' this...

22:58.502 --> 23:00.921
The hell are those gonks?

23:01.004 --> 23:04.674
We gonna sit here and let 'em clown us?

23:04.758 --> 23:07.761
- Damn badges think they can step on us!
- Oh shit, my ride!

23:07.844 --> 23:08.970
What're you watching?

23:11.223 --> 23:14.351
"Burst Panic: The Big Crash."

23:16.019 --> 23:17.187
Never heard of it.

23:18.188 --> 23:19.606
That's them! We've got 'em!

23:19.689 --> 23:20.941
Kinda figured.

23:26.071 --> 23:28.698
Static-ass streetpunks! Bring it on!

23:28.782 --> 23:31.952
It's... set in the Badlands... is it?

23:32.035 --> 23:35.205
Yup. It's a nomad flick, after all.

23:36.039 --> 23:37.791
Can it!

23:38.291 --> 23:40.460
Muster some backbone for once!

23:40.544 --> 23:42.045
Who the hell is that?

23:44.005 --> 23:47.467
I'm the goddamn sheriff of this land!

23:47.551 --> 23:49.719
You scum!

23:50.470 --> 23:51.972
Gimme the Lexington.

23:53.849 --> 23:56.476
Never thought I'd use a Lexington again...

23:57.060 --> 23:59.646
Takes me back to my rookie days.

24:07.320 --> 24:08.405
Avida...

24:11.825 --> 24:14.035
Wish I could've seen you one last time--

24:16.496 --> 24:17.706
Avida?

24:31.219 --> 24:32.762
Avida!

26:38.930 --> 26:43.935
Subtitle translation by:
CD PROJEKT RED & Megumi Hunter
